{
    "_about":  "Per-foot YAW correction + arm tilt for bandy / toe-out legs. Ported from OpenTrident clip-panel.js fitClip (footYaw rotates the Foot about the shin axis; arm tilt premultiplies the upper-arm local rotation about the parent X axis). handedSign: glTF to Unity flips handedness, which reverses the sense of an axis-angle about a reflected axis; -1 reproduces the web look, flip to 1 if the toes turn the wrong way. footYaw = [left, right] degrees. Categories are matched by Animator state short name; the first match wins, unmatched states use the row footYaw. During an Animator transition the values are blended by the transition normalizedTime.",
